{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'git status --short --branch && git log --oneline --decorate -12 && gh issue view 45 --repo mrkkucharski/vgt --comments && gh pr view 51 --repo mrkkucharski/vgt --json number,title,state,isDraft,baseRefName,headRefName,mergeStateStatus,mergeable,commits,files,body,reviews'","aggregated_output":"author:\tmrkkucharski\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\nDependency check: #43 is closed, but #44 is still open. Per this issue’s explicit instruction not to start until both dependencies are closed, no implementation work has been started. I am leaving the status unchanged; this is dependency ordering, not a human/external blocker.\n--\nauthor:\tmrkkucharski\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\nImplemented and pushed LALAL API v1 backend (commits 68ceb76, 28794f7). Includes v1 upload/split/check/limits/cancel/delete, durable source/task/idempotency checkpoints with fail-closed ambiguity handling, bounded polling and WAV download validation, effective-model pinning, mocked HTTP tests, and an opt-in manual smoke-test procedure. Verified: 55 backend/project tests and 19 analysis tests pass (3 pre-existing Python deprecation warnings).\n--\n{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"Closes #45\\n\\n## Changes\\n\\nSee issue #45 for details.\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:15:14Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"marekkucharski@mini.local\",\"id\":\"\",\"login\":\"\",\"name\":\"Marek Kucharski\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:15:14Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"feat(separation): add LALAL API v1 backend\",\"oid\":\"68ceb768cf8ae583628928f1ff8ac0bd32cc87dd\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:15:49Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"marekkucharski@mini.local\",\"id\":\"\",\"login\":\"\",\"name\":\"Marek Kucharski\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:15:49Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(separation): pin effective LALAL auto model\",\"oid\":\"28794f7848f9f68777698e1eb74880455631d5c9\"}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"docs/lalal-v1-smoke-test.md\",\"additions\":9,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"pyproject.toml\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/vgt/lalal.py\",\"additions\":295,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"src/vgt/separation.py\",\"additions\":24,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"tests/test_lalal.py\",\"additions\":144,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"uv.lock\",\"additions\":52,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"headRefName\":\"issue-45-m1-b-lalal-api-v1-backend-lalalseparator\",\"isDraft\":false,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"CLEAN\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"number\":51,\"reviews\":[],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"M1-B: LALAL API v1 backend (LalalSeparator)\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
